Introduction:

Here is another game from me, DragonLord. I also wrote this game a few
years ago. This game needs no explanation. Anyone could figure it out.

                                                --Paul Taulborg


Legal Crap:

        You know, this is presented as is. I take no responsibility for any
harm done to your system due to this program. Changing anything herein is
illegal.. blah blah...

        You're not a moron. You know the rules. You know whats going on.
Don't change my program, and it won't abuse you.


How To Install:

Unarc the file into your Pfiles directory. Add an ARexx pfile, name:
pfiles:destroy/destroy.rexx

Your done!


Registering/Donating:

        Well, this game isn't exactly "shareware", nor is it giftware. But
somewhere in between... There is no registered version, however, if I get
people emailing me with interest in this game to further support it, I will
more than likely oblige. If I get gifts in the mail, that would make my
day, and thus, I would definately continue support for this fine RPG. If
you'd like more information, or have suggestions/improvements, or would
like to donate anything to me, write to me at:

        dragonlord@omahalink.net

